WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.687
Client logos has a familiar list and ordering workflow.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:10.079
Each client has an organisation name, logo, and optional website link.

00:00:10.129 --> 00:00:15.471
Choose a logo from the media library, preview the result, and publish.

00:00:15.521 --> 00:00:19.861
Only show organisations whose logo use has been approved.
